// Spike #137 (never merged): text with bitmap fonts baked by stb_truetype against multi-channel signed
// distance fields generated by msdfgen from the same TrueType outlines. Both atlases hold printable ASCII;
// the top half of the window draws seven sizes with the bitmap atlas, the bottom half the same lines with
// the MSDF atlas.
//
// The bitmap half bakes every size it draws (--single-bake: one 32 px bake scaled to every size instead).
//
//   teserra_spike_text [--font <file.ttf>] [--single-bake]  interactive; Escape quits
//   teserra_spike_text --screenshot <file.png> [...]        renders once, writes the PNG, a 3x crop of the small
//                                                           sizes (<file>-zoom.png) and the numbers, exits

